          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 56032,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finora gli oggetti che abbiamo creato dalle classi non possono eseguire alcuna azione.</p><p>Aggiungendo <strong>metodi</strong> alle classi, potrai creare oggetti interattivi usando le classi come modelli.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Methods",
            "id": 56043,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungere un metodo in una classe è come creare una normale funzione, tranne per il fatto che non è necessario usare la parola chiave <code>function</code>.</p><p>Questa classe <code>VirtualPet</code> non sa ancora fare molto. Aggiungiamole la capacità di mangiare con un metodo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>eat</code>, seguito da <code>()</code> e poi <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungere un metodo in una classe è come creare una normale funzione, tranne per il fatto che non è necessario usare la parola chiave <code>function</code>.</p><p>Questa classe <code>VirtualPet</code> non sa ancora fare molto. Assegna a ogni animale domestico un metodo <code>eat</code> vuoto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"eat:\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>eat</code>, seguito da <code>()</code>, <code>{</code> e infine <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Methods",
            "id": 56045,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno delle parentesi graffe, i metodi funzionano come normali funzioni.</p><p>Usiamo <code>console.log</code> per visualizzare un messaggio nella console quando viene chiamata <code>eat()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"87\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>console.log</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Create the object",
            "id": 56048,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di poter usare il metodo <code>eat()</code>, dobbiamo creare un nuovo oggetto dalla classe.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>pet</code> e poi <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>VirtualPet</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prima di poter usare il metodo <code>eat()</code>, dobbiamo creare un nuovo oggetto dalla classe.</p><p>Crea la costante <code>pet</code> da <code>VirtualPet</code>, con il nome <code>\"Tom\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"106\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Mia&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>const</code>, seguito da <code>pet</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>VirtualPet</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>\"Tom\"</code>, <code>)</code> e infine <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Methods",
            "id": 56049,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare il metodo <code>eat()</code>, ci serviranno il nome dell'oggetto, un punto, il nome del metodo e le parentesi.</p><code version=\"2\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.eat();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"151\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Tom.eat()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pet.eat\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"nom nom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pet.eat();</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per usare il metodo <code>eat()</code>, ci serviranno il nome dell'oggetto, un punto, il nome del metodo e le parentesi.</p><p>Fai in modo che l'animale domestico chiamato Tom stampi <code>nom nom</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.eat();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"151\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Tom.eat()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pet.eat\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"VirtualPet.eat()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"nom nom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>pet.eat();</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Parameters",
            "id": 56051,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>I parametri permettono ai metodi di classe di essere più interattivi, reagendo a ciò che forniamo loro.</p><p>Aggiungi un parametro chiamato <code>food</code> al metodo <code>eat()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat(food) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"72\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>food</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Reactive",
            "id": 56053,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con un'istruzione condizionale, gli oggetti che creiamo potranno reagire al tipo di cibo che passiamo a <code>eat()</code>.</p><p>Completa l'aggiunta dell'istruzione che verifica se <code>food</code> ha un valore specifico.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat(food) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (food === \" /><text value=\"&quot;treats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;discard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.eat();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"167\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"discard\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if (food === \"treats\")</code>, seguito da <code>else</code> e infine <code>console.log(\"discard\");</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Con un'istruzione condizionale, gli oggetti che creiamo potranno reagire al tipo di cibo che passiamo a <code>eat()</code>.</p><p>Fai in modo che l'animale domestico stampi <code>discard</code> quando non riceve treats.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat(food) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (food === \" /><text value=\"&quot;treats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;discard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.eat();\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"100\" /><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"167\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"if (food = &quot;treats&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"else if\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console.log(&quot;nom nom&quot;);\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"discard\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>if (food === \"treats\")</code>, seguito da <code>else</code> e infine <code>console.log(\"discard\");</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Feed it",
            "id": 56054,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ogni nuovo oggetto della classe <code>VirtualPet</code> che creiamo potrà usare il metodo <code>eat()</code>.</p><p>Chiama di nuovo <code>eat()</code>, ma questa volta passagli <code>\"treats\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" eat(food) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (food === \" /><text value=\"&quot;treats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;nom nom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;discard&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pet = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" VirtualPet(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pet.eat(\" /><text value=\"&quot;treats&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"220\" endIndex=\"228\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"nom nom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>\"treats\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: method",
            "id": 56034,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di questi è il modo corretto per iniziare a creare un metodo chiamato <code>update</code> all'interno di una classe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>update()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function update()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>update()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>All'interno del corpo di una classe, quale intestazione avvia un metodo chiamato <code>update</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>update()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function update()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>method update()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>update()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: method 2",
            "id": 56035,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La chiamata a un metodo di classe può restituire un valore?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Sì.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Una classe definisce <code>batteryLevel() { return 80; }</code>. Che cosa restituisce <code>device.batteryLevel()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il numero 80.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Il metodo batteryLevel stesso.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nessun valore, perché solo i costruttori possono restituire valori.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il numero 80.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: method 3",
            "id": 56036,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale di queste affermazioni è vera riguardo a classi e metodi?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Gli oggetti creati da una classe hanno accesso ai suoi metodi</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Gli oggetti non hanno accesso ai metodi di una classe</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gli oggetti creati da una classe hanno accesso ai suoi metodi.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crei due oggetti con <code>new VirtualPet(\"Tom\")</code> e <code>new VirtualPet(\"Mia\")</code>. Quale può chiamare <code>eat()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Entrambi gli oggetti possono chiamare eat().</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo il primo oggetto può chiamare eat().</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo VirtualPet può chiamare eat().</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Entrambi gli oggetti possono chiamare eat().</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
